        <obo:IAO_0000115>A group of skeletal muscles attached to the auricular cartilage that act to move the pinna, comprising the auricularis anterior, auricularis superior, and auricularis posterior.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000233 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI">https://github.com/obophenotype/uberon/issues/3707</obo:IAO_0000233>
