        <obo:IAO_0000115>A skeletal muscle organ that is the medial part of the posterior cervical intertransversarius, lying medial to the dorsal ramus of the cervical spinal nerve which pierces it, connecting the posterior tubercles of adjacent cervical vertebrae and acting to laterally flex the cervical spine.</obo:IAO_0000115>
