            </Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A skeletal muscle of the deep layer of the back, forming the thoracic portion of the multifidus and part of the transversospinales muscle group. It arises from the transverse processes of the thoracic vertebrae and ascends superomedially to insert into the spinous processes of vertebrae two to five segments above its origin, producing extension, ipsilateral lateral flexion and contralateral rotation of the thoracic vertebral column.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000233 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI">https://github.com/obophenotype/uberon/issues/3707</obo:IAO_0000233>
