        <obo:IAO_0000115>A group of skeletal muscles located in the posterior part of the abdominal wall that support the lumbar spine and act on the trunk and hip, comprising the psoas major, psoas minor, iliacus, and quadratus lumborum muscles.</obo:IAO_0000115>
