        <obo:IAO_0000115>A muscle of the pelvis that arises from the inner surface of the pubic bone and inserts into the perineal body, forming part of the pubovisceral component of the levator ani muscle and contributing to support of the pelvic floor and elevation of the perineal body.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000233 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI">https://github.com/obophenotype/uberon/issues/3707</obo:IAO_0000233>
