                    </Restriction>
                </intersectionOf>
            </Class>
        </equivalentClass>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A group of skeletal muscles located in the plantar part of the foot that act on the toes and support the longitudinal arch, comprising the four layers of plantar intrinsic muscles including the abductor hallucis, flexor digitorum brevis, lumbricals, quadratus plantae, flexor digiti minimi brevis, adductor hallucis, and plantar/dorsal interossei.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000233 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI">https://github.com/obophenotype/uberon/issues/3707</obo:IAO_0000233>
