        <obo:IAO_0000115>A muscle head that forms the larger inferior portion of the pectoralis major, originating from the anterior surface of the sternum, the superior six costal cartilages, and the aponeurosis of the external oblique muscle, and inserting together with the clavicular head onto the lateral lip of the intertubercular groove of the humerus.</obo:IAO_0000115>
