        <obo:IAO_0000115>A skeletal muscle organ that is one of a series of small segmental muscles, typically present only between the lower thoracic vertebrae and between the last thoracic and first lumbar vertebra, connecting adjacent transverse processes and innervated by the dorsal rami of the thoracic spinal nerves.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000233 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI">https://github.com/obophenotype/uberon/issues/3707</obo:IAO_0000233>
